        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Add sponsored skill format, declared installs, and ad lab bench",
        "summary": "The sponsored ads subsystem gains a skill format and a declared install gate: `sponsored-declared-installs.ts` lets a run install only the exact packages its skill declares, executing them with `--ignore-scripts` and `--save-exact` to skip lifecycle hooks. The CLI's `sponsored-run.ts` now resolves declared packages from the procedure hash and replaces the blanket install refusal with this check, while `sponsored-step-driver.ts` adds a harness-driven step loop that validates agent work against deterministic checks. The Agentic Ads Lab gains `agentic-ad-lab-bench.ts` with a pinned `LAB_BENCH` of 25 repositories and a `compareLabBatches` gate that blocks regression on any single repository, alongside raising `LAB_BATCH_MAX_REPOSITORIES` to 30 in `agentic-ad-lab-batch.ts`.",
        "significance": "major",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "The diff introduces `sponsored-declared-installs.ts` and `sponsored-skill.ts` in `common/src/ads/`, adds `agentic-ad-lab-bench.ts` with `LAB_BENCH`, and modifies `cli/src/utils/sponsored-run.ts` to use `evaluateSponsoredInstallCommand` for package installation checks.",
